{
  "iron": 1,
  "root": {
    "class": "Form",
    "name": "frmExport",
    "width": 1600,
    "height": 900,
    "children": [
      {
        "class": "Panel",
        "name": "pnlExport",
        "style": "pane",
        "align": "client",
        "children": [
          {
            "class": "Panel",
            "name": "pnlExHead",
            "style": "ex_head",
            "align": "top",
            "height": 49,
            "children": [
              { "class": "Rectangle", "name": "lnExHead", "style": "sep", "align": "bottom", "height": 1 },
              { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExClose", "style": "s_back", "icon": "arrow-left", "icon_size": 18, "text": "", "align": "left", "width": 28, "margins": [18, 10, 10, 10], "on_click": "export_close" },
              { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExTitle", "style": "ex_title", "align": "client", "text": "Exportar gravação" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "class": "ScrollBox",
            "name": "scrExport",
            "align": "client",
            "padding": [0, 0, 0, 0],
            "children": [
              {
                "class": "Layout",
                "name": "lyExport",
                "align": "top",
                "height": 100,
                "padding": [18, 18, 18, 40],
                "on_resize": "export_resize",
                "children": [
                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExRegionsHead", "style": "ex_label", "align": "top", "height": 16.8, "margins": [0, 0, 0, 7], "text": "Telas" },
                  { "class": "FlowLayout", "name": "flwExRegions", "align": "top", "height": 30.1, "gap": 6, "line_gap": 6 },
                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExRegionsHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "A prévia abaixo já mostra o resultado: as telas escolhidas ficam lado a lado, sem espaço vazio. \"Nenhuma\" exporta só o áudio. Escolher uma tela desfaz o recorte feito na prévia." },

                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExRangeHead", "style": "ex_label", "align": "top", "height": 16.8, "margins": [0, 16, 0, 7], "text": "Trechos" },
                  {
                    "class": "Panel",
                    "name": "pnlExStage",
                    "style": "ex_stage",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 300,
                    "clip_children": true,
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "FrameView", "name": "fvExFrame", "on_pointer_down": "export_stage_down", "on_pointer_move": "export_stage_move", "on_pointer_up": "export_stage_up", "on_wheel": "export_stage_wheel" },
                      { "class": "CropBox", "name": "crpExCrop", "captures_wheel": true, "min_size": 32, "snap": 2, "framed": true, "visible": false, "on_change": "export_crop_change", "on_end": "export_crop_end", "on_tap": "export_play", "on_wheel": "export_stage_wheel" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExMsg", "style": "pl_loading", "align": "center", "width": 420, "height": 40, "h_align": "center", "hit_test": false, "text": "" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExAudioOnly", "style": "ex_badge", "align": "center", "width": 300, "height": 34, "h_align": "center", "hit_test": false, "visible": false, "text": "Só o áudio será exportado" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExCaption", "style": "pl_caption", "height": 40, "h_align": "center", "wrap": true, "outline": "black/90", "outline_width": 2, "hit_test": false, "visible": false, "text": "" }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExCrop",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 24,
                    "margins": [0, 7, 0, 0],
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExCropReset", "style": "ex_sm", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 100, "height": 24, "text": "Usar tela inteira", "on_click": "export_crop_reset" },
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExZoomOut", "style": "ex_zoom", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 26, "height": 23.3, "margins": [12, 0, 0, 0], "text": "−", "hint": "Afastar (Ctrl + −, ou roda do mouse na barra)", "on_click": "export_crop_zoom_out" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExZoom", "style": "ex_val", "align": "left", "width": 42, "h_align": "center", "text": "100%" },
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExZoomIn", "style": "ex_zoom", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 26, "height": 23.3, "text": "+", "hint": "Aproximar (Ctrl + +, ou roda do mouse na barra)", "on_click": "export_crop_zoom_in" },
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExZoomReset", "style": "ex_sm", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 50, "height": 24, "margins": [8, 0, 0, 0], "text": "100%", "on_click": "export_crop_zoom_reset" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExCropInfo", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "client", "trimming": "character", "margins": [8, 0, 0, 0], "text": "" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExCropHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "Arraste as bordas da prévia para recortar; arraste o meio da moldura para reposicionar. Ctrl + roda do mouse aproxima (ou os botões − e + acima). Com a prévia aproximada, arraste com o botão do meio do mouse — ou com Shift + botão esquerdo — para deslocar a vista e alcançar as outras partes da imagem." },
                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExPlay",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 24.3,
                    "margins": [0, 8, 0, 0],
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExPlay", "style": "ex_sm", "icon": "pl-play", "icon_size": 13, "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 28, "height": 24.3, "text": "", "on_click": "export_play" },
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExMute", "style": "ex_sm", "icon": "pl-vol-high", "icon_size": 13, "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 28, "height": 24.3, "margins": [10, 0, 0, 0], "text": "", "on_click": "export_mute" },
                      { "class": "TrackBar", "name": "trkExVolume", "style": "ex", "min": 0, "max": 100, "frequency": 1, "thumb_size": 16, "track_size": 8, "solid_thumb": true, "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 92, "margins": [10, 0, 0, 0], "value": 100, "on_change": "export_volume" },
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExCc", "style": "ex_cc", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 28, "margins": [10, 0.8, 0, 0.8], "text": "CC", "on_click": "export_cc" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExSpaceHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "client", "h_align": "trailing", "text": "Espaço toca/pausa" }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExTimeline",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 73,
                    "margins": [0, 10, 0, 0],
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "class": "Panel",
                        "name": "pnlExTl",
                        "style": "ex_tl",
                        "align": "client",
                        "clip_children": true,
                        "children": [
                          { "class": "Rectangle", "name": "shpExRuler", "style": "ex_ruler", "left": 1, "top": 47, "width": 100, "height": 17, "hit_test": false },
                          { "class": "Rectangle", "name": "shpExRulerLine", "style": "ex_tick", "left": 1, "top": 47, "width": 100, "height": 1, "hit_test": false },
                          { "class": "Image", "name": "imgExTl", "captures_wheel": true, "fit": "stretch", "left": 1, "top": 1, "width": 100, "height": 46, "cursor": "pointer", "on_pointer_down": "export_tl_down", "on_pointer_move": "export_tl_move", "on_pointer_up": "export_tl_up", "on_wheel": "export_tl_wheel" },
                          {
                            "class": "Panel",
                            "name": "pnlExSb",
                            "style": "flat",
                            "left": 1,
                            "top": 64,
                            "width": 100,
                            "height": 8,
                            "children": [
                              { "class": "Rectangle", "name": "shpExSbThumb", "style": "ex_sb", "left": 0, "top": 0, "width": 100, "height": 8, "cursor": "pointer", "on_pointer_down": "export_sb_down", "on_pointer_move": "export_sb_move", "on_pointer_up": "export_sb_up" }
                            ]
                          },
                          { "class": "Layout", "name": "lyExTlLabels", "left": 1, "top": 1, "width": 100, "height": 46, "hit_test": false },
                          { "class": "Layout", "name": "lyExTicks", "left": 1, "top": 47, "width": 100, "height": 17, "hit_test": false },
                          { "class": "Rectangle", "name": "shpExPlayShade", "fill": "black/50", "stroke_width": 0, "left": 0, "top": 1, "width": 4, "height": 46, "hit_test": false, "visible": false },
                          { "class": "Rectangle", "name": "shpExPlayLine", "fill": "text", "stroke_width": 0, "left": 1, "top": 1, "width": 2, "height": 46, "hit_test": false, "visible": false }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExTlBar",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 29.3,
                    "margins": [0, 9, 0, 0],
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExCut", "style": "ex_sm", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 80, "height": 24, "margins": [0, 2.65, 0, 2.65], "text": "Dividir aqui", "on_click": "export_cut" },
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExUncut", "style": "ex_sm", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 100, "height": 24, "margins": [10, 2.65, 0, 2.65], "text": "Remover divisão", "on_click": "export_uncut" },
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExToggle", "style": "ex_sm", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 80, "height": 24, "margins": [10, 2.65, 0, 2.65], "text": "Tirar trecho", "on_click": "export_toggle" },
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExTlZoomOut", "style": "ex_zoom", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 26, "height": 23.3, "margins": [14, 3, 0, 3], "text": "−", "hint": "Afastar (Ctrl + −, ou roda do mouse na barra)", "on_click": "export_tl_zoom_out" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExTlZoom", "style": "ex_val", "align": "left", "width": 42, "h_align": "center", "text": "100%" },
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExTlZoomIn", "style": "ex_zoom", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 26, "height": 23.3, "margins": [0, 3, 0, 3], "text": "+", "hint": "Aproximar (Ctrl + +, ou roda do mouse na barra)", "on_click": "export_tl_zoom_in" },
                      { "class": "Edit", "name": "edtExTime", "style": "ex", "h_align": "center", "align": "left", "width": 74, "height": 29.3, "margins": [10, 0, 0, 0], "text": "00:00", "on_exit": "export_time_exit", "on_key_down": "export_time_key" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExRangeLen", "style": "ex_val2", "align": "right", "h_align": "trailing", "text": "" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExRangeText", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "client", "margins": [10, 0, 0, 0], "text": "" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExRangeHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "Arraste na barra para mover o cursor; use a roda do mouse sobre ela (ou Ctrl + + / Ctrl + −) para aproximar e acertar o segundo exato. \"Dividir aqui\" corta no ponto do cursor; \"Remover divisão\" desfaz a divisão mais próxima (destacada em vermelho); \"Tirar trecho\" remove do vídeo final o trecho onde o cursor está. Os trechos mantidos são emendados na ordem, sem buraco." },

                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExAudio",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 10,
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExAudioHead", "style": "ex_label", "align": "top", "height": 16.8, "margins": [0, 16, 0, 7], "text": "Áudio" },
                      {
                        "class": "Layout",
                        "name": "lyExOrigRow",
                        "align": "top",
                        "height": 30.1,
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "class": "Panel",
                            "name": "pnlExOrig",
                            "style": "ex_chk",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": 100,
                            "height": 30.1,
                            "padding": [11, 0, 0, 0],
                            "cursor": "pointer",
                            "on_click": "export_orig",
                            "children": [
                              { "class": "CheckBox", "name": "chkExOrig", "style": "web", "box_size": 13, "text": "", "align": "left", "width": 13, "margins": [0, 8.5, 6, 8.6], "hit_test": false },
                              { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExOrig", "style": "ex_chk", "align": "client", "hit_test": false, "text": "Manter o áudio original (as mesmas faixas da gravação)" }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      { "class": "FlowLayout", "name": "flwExTracks", "align": "top", "height": 30.1, "margins": [0, 7, 0, 0], "gap": 6, "line_gap": 6 },
                      {
                        "class": "Layout",
                        "name": "lyExMixRow",
                        "align": "top",
                        "height": 30.1,
                        "margins": [0, 7, 0, 0],
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "class": "Panel",
                            "name": "pnlExMix",
                            "style": "ex_chk",
                            "align": "left",
                            "width": 100,
                            "height": 30.1,
                            "padding": [11, 0, 0, 0],
                            "cursor": "pointer",
                            "on_click": "export_mix",
                            "children": [
                              { "class": "CheckBox", "name": "chkExMix", "style": "web", "box_size": 13, "text": "", "align": "left", "width": 13, "margins": [0, 8.5, 6, 8.6], "hit_test": false },
                              { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExMix", "style": "ex_chk", "align": "client", "hit_test": false, "text": "Juntar as faixas em uma só" }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },

                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExVideoHead",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 18.2,
                    "margins": [0, 16, 0, 0],
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExResHead", "style": "ex_col", "align": "left", "width": 400, "text": "Resolução" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExEncHead", "style": "ex_col", "align": "client", "text": "Codificador" }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExVideoRow",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 28.7,
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "ComboBox", "name": "cmbExRes", "style": "ex", "arrow": "triangle", "align": "left", "width": 400, "height": 28.7, "margins": [0, 0, 10, 0], "on_change": "export_res" },
                      { "class": "ComboBox", "name": "cmbExEnc", "style": "ex", "arrow": "triangle", "align": "client", "height": 28.7, "on_change": "export_enc" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExResHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "Reduzir a resolução é o que mais diminui o arquivo. Nunca aumentamos além do original." },

                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExScale",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 10,
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExScaleHead", "style": "ex_label", "align": "top", "height": 16.8, "margins": [0, 16, 0, 7], "text": "Redimensionamento" },
                      {
                        "class": "Layout",
                        "name": "lyExScaleRow",
                        "align": "top",
                        "height": 28.7,
                        "children": [
                          { "class": "ComboBox", "name": "cmbExScale", "style": "ex", "arrow": "triangle", "align": "client", "height": 28.7, "on_change": "export_scale" }
                        ]
                      },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExScaleHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "" }
                    ]
                  },

                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExSpeedHead", "style": "ex_label", "align": "top", "height": 16.8, "margins": [0, 16, 0, 7], "text": "Velocidade" },
                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExSpeedRow",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 29.3,
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Edit", "name": "edtExSpeed", "style": "ex", "h_align": "trailing", "align": "left", "width": 74, "height": 29.3, "text": "1", "on_change": "export_speed_change", "on_exit": "export_speed_exit", "on_key_down": "export_speed_key" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExSpeedX", "style": "ex_x", "align": "left", "width": 20, "margins": [10, 0, 0, 0], "hit_test": false, "text": "×" },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExSpeedValue", "style": "ex_val", "align": "client", "h_align": "trailing", "text": "" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExSpeedHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "Acelera o vídeo e o áudio (a voz mantém o tom), de 1× até 512×. Todos os quadros são lidos: acelerado, cabem mais quadros por segundo — um vídeo de 60 fps a 2× pode sair com até 120 fps." },

                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExFps",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 10,
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExFpsHead", "style": "ex_label", "align": "top", "height": 16.8, "margins": [0, 16, 0, 7], "text": "Quadros por segundo" },
                      {
                        "class": "Layout",
                        "name": "lyExFpsRow",
                        "align": "top",
                        "height": 16,
                        "children": [
                          { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExFps", "style": "ex_val", "align": "right", "margins": [10, 0, 0, 0], "text": "" },
                          { "class": "TrackBar", "name": "trkExFps", "style": "ex", "min": 20, "max": 60, "frequency": 1, "thumb_size": 16, "track_size": 8, "solid_thumb": true, "tab_stop": false, "align": "client", "on_change": "export_fps" }
                        ]
                      },
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExFpsHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "Menos quadros por segundo deixam o arquivo menor e a exportação mais rápida, ao custo de fluidez. Acima de 60 fps o ganho de tamanho é pequeno: quadros vizinhos são quase idênticos e custam pouco." }
                    ]
                  },

                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExQualityHead", "style": "ex_label", "align": "top", "height": 16.8, "margins": [0, 16, 0, 7], "text": "Qualidade (CRF)" },
                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExQualityRow",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 16,
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExQuality", "style": "ex_val", "align": "right", "margins": [10, 0, 0, 0], "text": "" },
                      { "class": "TrackBar", "name": "trkExQuality", "style": "ex", "min": 0, "max": 51, "frequency": 1, "thumb_size": 16, "track_size": 8, "solid_thumb": true, "tab_stop": false, "align": "client", "on_change": "export_quality" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExQualityHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "" },

                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExCaptionHead", "style": "ex_label", "align": "top", "height": 16.8, "margins": [0, 16, 0, 7], "text": "Legenda" },
                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExBurnRow",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 30.1,
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "class": "Panel",
                        "name": "pnlExBurn",
                        "style": "ex_chk",
                        "align": "left",
                        "width": 100,
                        "height": 30.1,
                        "padding": [11, 0, 0, 0],
                        "cursor": "pointer",
                        "on_click": "export_burn",
                        "children": [
                          { "class": "CheckBox", "name": "chkExBurn", "style": "web", "box_size": 13, "text": "", "align": "left", "width": 13, "margins": [0, 8.5, 6, 8.6], "hit_test": false },
                          { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExBurn", "style": "ex_chk", "align": "client", "hit_test": false, "text": "Gravar a legenda no vídeo" }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExCaptionHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "" },

                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExNameHead", "style": "ex_label", "align": "top", "height": 16.8, "margins": [0, 16, 0, 7], "text": "Nome do arquivo" },
                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExNameRow",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 29.3,
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "ComboBox", "name": "cmbExCont", "style": "ex", "arrow": "triangle", "align": "right", "width": 96, "height": 28.7, "margins": [10, 0.3, 0, 0.3], "on_change": "export_cont" },
                      { "class": "Edit", "name": "edtExName", "style": "ex", "align": "client", "height": 29.3, "text": "" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "class": "Label", "name": "lblExContHint", "style": "ex_hint", "align": "top", "height": 16, "wrap": true, "v_align": "leading", "margins": [0, 6, 0, 0], "text": "" },

                  {
                    "class": "Layout",
                    "name": "lyExActions",
                    "align": "top",
                    "height": 29.3,
                    "margins": [0, 20, 0, 0],
                    "children": [
                      { "class": "Button", "name": "btnExRun", "style": "ex_primary", "tab_stop": false, "align": "left", "width": 80, "height": 29.3, "text": "Exportar", "on_click": "export_run" },
